2.
Definitions. - In these regulations, unless the context otherwise requires,-
(i)
"Act" means the Foreign Exchange Management Act, 1999 (
42 of 1999
);
(ii)
"authorised dealer" means a person authorised as an authorised dealer under sub-section (1) of section 10 of the Act;
(iii)
"Foreign Currency Account" means an account held or maintained in currency other than the currency of India or Nepal
or Bhutan;
(iv)
"Schedule" means a Schedule to these regulations;
(v)
the words and expressions used but not defined in these regulations shall have the same meanings respectively
assigned to them in the Act.
